   Title: Command Menu Fonts
   Description: Font picker command menu with font preview, weight selection, and categories for React design tools
   Long Description: Choose fonts with family search, live preview, weight/style selection, and font categories. Perfect for design tools, document editors, or any React app with font customization.
   Dependencies: BadgeCn, ButtonCn, CommandCn, DialogCn, KbdCn
   Source: original/blocks/command-menu/command-menu-fonts.tsx
